            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.53

- Side A looks for updates every hour and on wake, instead of once a day.
- A background check that never finishes no longer leaves accounts, limits and usage stale.
- Side A Remote reconnects to the relay on the first try after a dropped connection.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
